<title>USA: Virologix IPO postponed -- underwriter.</title>
<headline>Virologix IPO postponed -- underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering in Virologix Corp was postponed indefinitely due to market conditions, lead underwriter Rickel &amp; Associates said on Monday.</p>
<p>Virologix proposed 1.075 million shares at a target price of $6 under the symbol &quot;VRLX&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market. Originally, 1.15 million shares were proposed. The initial public offering was expected to price this week.</p>
<p>Virologix is a biotech company.</p>
</text>
